				<h1>General</h1>
				
				
					
						<h3>What is iDAL?</h3>
<p>iDAL is a platform and a community for talent. We provide an alternative to traditional model agencies by streamlining bookings with an advanced platform structure whilst maintaining professional services and a high standard of talent.</p> 
<h3>Why is booking through iDAL beneficial?</h3>
<p>Through our transparent and easy-to-use platform, you gain direct access to talent, and have all the necessary tools to cast and book models online,  increasing efficiency, cutting costs, and contributing to an effort to make the industry more transparent and safe for everyone.</p>
<h3>Who can be a model at iDAL?</h3>
<p>iDAL is for entrepreneurial models - modelpreneurs. Those models who want to have full control over their careers and are business-savvy and proactive. </p>
<p>All of our models are over 18, have the right to work in the UK and have professional portfolios and social media profiles. Our experienced managers verify each and every model before they appear on the iDAL talent page.</p> 
<h3>How do I search for talent at iDAL?</h3>
<p>To discover models on iDAL you can use our filter search which you can find to the left of the screen on the Talent page.</p>
<h3>How do I make a booking at iDAL?</h3>
<p>To make a booking you have to go to the Book page and create a project. From there you have to select the correct category you would like to book models for, and fill in all the necessary details. Please provide as much information as possible so that the model can make an informed decision. Should you need any assistance please email <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a> or call 020 8187 7737.</p>
<h3>How do I cast models though iDAL?</h3>
<p>To cast models you have to go to our booking page and create a project. From there you will have to select “cast models for an upcoming project” and fill in all the details. Please provide as much information as possible so that the model can make an informed decision. Should you need any assistance please email <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a> or call 020 8187 7737.</p>
<h3>How do usage rights work at iDAL?</h3>
<p>To document your usage rights, you need to opt in for your expected usage when creating a project and provide as many details as possible so the model can make an informed decision of your job offer and your offered rate. Should you need to extend or require additional usage rights please email <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a> or call 020 8187 7737.</p>
<h3>Will I have a contract for jobs booked through iDAL?</h3>
<p>For each booking both the model and client will agree to the standard booking terms directly on the platform. Should you require specific contract arrangements, please reach out at <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a>.</p>
<h3>Why can models negotiate on iDAL and how do I deal with negotiations?</h3>
<p>On iDAL models are able to negotiate their own rates. Through our workshops and educational resources, we help our models to understand industry standard, so that they can do so in a professional manner. Should a model negotiate with you, you can accept, reject or counteroffer.</p> 
<h3>How do I pay for bookings at iDAL?</h3>
<p>You are able to pay for your bookings on the ‘Payments’ page. Your total payment will usually include our 10% booking fee and VAT unless stated otherwise. You may pay online by debit card. If you wish to pay by invoice and do not see this function on the Payments page, request this option at <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a>.</p>
<h3>Can I participate in iDAL Voices events?</h3>
<p>Our iDAL Voices events are usually only open to our models. However, should you be interested in collaborating on an event, we always look forward to hearing your ideas & suggestions. Please email us at <a href="mailto:hello@idal.co">hello@idal.co</a></p>
<h3>Why can’t I chat with models?</h3>
<p>Safety is at the core of iDAL which is why we do not allow direct communication with our models. Should you have any questions or need help please email us at <a href="mailto:support@idal.co">support@idal.co</a>.</p>
<h3>How do models benefit from using iDAL?</h3>
<p>On our platform, models have all the necessary tools to manage their careers independently from an agency and pay only 10% commission instead of the usual 20 - 40%, while benefiting from absolute financial transparency. They also become a part of our community of entrepreneurial models, and get access to our community resources for education, events and support.</p>

				
